shape: sequence_diagram
Test Script: Test Script
Gateway: Gateway
url-service: url-service
analytics-service: analytics-service
notification-service: notification-service
Test Script -> Gateway: 1. POST /api/auth/register
Test Script -> Gateway: 2. POST /api/auth/login -> get TOKEN
Test Script -> Gateway: 3. POST /api/shorten (with TOKEN) -> SHORT_CODE
Test Script -> Gateway: '4. GET /r/{SHORT_CODE} (15 times)'
note: 5. sleep 5s (wait for outbox + consumer)
Test Script -> analytics-service: '6. GET /api/stats/{SHORT_CODE}'
Test Script -> notification-service: 7. GET /api/notifications
Test Script -> Gateway: '8. DELETE /api/urls/{SHORT_CODE}'
Test Script -> Gateway: '9. GET /r/{SHORT_CODE} -> 410 Gone'
Test Script -> Gateway: 10. POST /api/shorten (11 times -> 429)
Test Script -> Gateway: 11. GET /health
